  "interpretation": "<h3 data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"451\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"451\">Allergy IgE Class Interpretation (Optional Table):</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong>Class</strong></span></th>\n<th><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong>IgE Level (kU/L)</strong></span></th>\n<th><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong>Interpretation</strong></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">0</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">&lt;0.35</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Negative</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">1</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">0.35 - 0.70</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Low Allergy</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">2</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">0.70 - 3.50</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Moderate Allergy</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">3</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">3.50 - 17.50</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">High Allergy</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">4</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">17.50 - 50</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Very High Allergy</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">5</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">50 - 100</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Strong Positive Allergy</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">6</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">&gt;100</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Extremely High Allergy</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1096\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1094\">Notes:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1304\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1159\">\n<p data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1159\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1114\">&lt;0.35 kU/L:</strong> Normal (No significant allergic reaction).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1233\">\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1233\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1184\">Higher IgE levels:</strong> Indicate allergic sensitization to house dust.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1304\">\n<p data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1304\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Interpretation should be done in correlation with clinical symptoms.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
